{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as Belphora, a daughter of war who lost her father in the battle against the Light. The forces of Light have taken over your castle\u2014your home. You are the sole survivor!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450800/extras/Steam_Gif_1.gif?t=1741270454\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in close combat against your own minions, who have fallen out of control. Use magical stones that can be embedded in your sword to gain special advantages. <br> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450800/extras/Steam_Gif_2.gif?t=1741270454\" /><br>To reclaim your castle, you must pass through the dark Darkmoon Forest and defeat its powerful guardian. Once you reach the castle, eliminate all enemies who have occupied your home and face the almighty Angel of Light to drive back the forces of Light. <br> <br>Key Features: Classic side-scroller with action-packed gameplay Explore various regions and discover hidden treasures Battle diverse enemies with unique fighting styles Confront two formidable bosses who stand in the way of your bloodline Collect souls and purchase useful equipment to grow stronger</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bloodrevenge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3450800/d17ee075b63545f9b35e433483edc50e73ab61ba.jpg"},{"name":"Soulscollector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3450800/67995ac8c3a1a8e8685ad0134b302726d6c06171.jpg"},{"name":"Soulsharvester","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3450800/c0192aa61db4b8c4b58006a40d96b047bd6ed0a3.jpg"},{"name":"Down with the Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3450800/f4751c4f780a378c10ddca8a3f70a011f896981c.jpg"},{"name":"Migthy Vict